" is the row type. The skeleton, empty data, loading text and height transition are handled by ",[322,327,319],{},"; when you do not need the card and pagination, use ",[322,330,319],{}," directly.",[333,334,336],"h2",{"id":335},"usage","Usage",[338,339,341],"h3",{"id":340},"server-side-pagination","Server-side pagination",[312,343,344,345,348,349,352,353,356,357,360,361,364],{},"Pagination is handled by the back end: the component emits ",[322,346,347],{},"page-change",", and the page updates ",[322,350,351],{},"page"," and ",[322,354,355],{},"data"," after the query for that page succeeds. It is not emitted while loading, or when the page is the current one or out of range. ",[322,358,359],{},"interactionDisabled"," is ",[322,362,363],{},"true"," while loading and can be used to disable actions in the list.",[366,367],"component-example",{"name":368},"list-card-basic",[312,370,371,372,375,376,379,380,383,384,388],{},"The ",[322,373,374],{},"PageRequest"," type can be imported from ",[322,377,378],{},"#shuo-ui\u002Ftypes\u002Fpagination","; see ",[316,381,72],{"href":382},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fadvanced\u002Fauto-imports#types",". For the full pattern with query fields, see ",[316,385,387],{"href":386},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#with-listcard","With ListCard"," on ShuoQueryCard.",[338,390,392],{"id":391},"title-and-icon","Title and icon",[312,394,395,398,399,402,403,379,406,410],{},[322,396,397],{},"title"," is the title text and ",[322,400,401],{},"icon"," is the icon to the left of the title; pass an empty string to hide the icon. The title bar wraps by the same rules as ",[322,404,405],{},"ShuoQueryCard",[316,407,409],{"href":408},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#long-titles","Long titles",".",[366,412],{"name":413},"list-card-title",[338,415,417],{"id":416},"pagination-and-counts","Pagination and counts",[312,419,420,423,424,427,428,431],{},[322,421,422],{},"show-pagination"," controls the pagination at the bottom left, shown even with a single page; ",[322,425,426],{},"show-summary"," controls the count and range at the bottom right; ",[322,429,430],{},"page-size"," is the number of rows per page, 10 by default.",[366,433],{"name":434},"list-card-footer",[436,437,438,452],"ul",{},[439,440,441,442,444,445,379,448,410],"li",{},"After changing ",[322,443,430],{},", query again from the first page with ",[322,446,447],{},"getPagination(1)",[316,449,451],{"href":450},"#re-querying-the-current-page","Re-querying the current page",[439,453,454,455,458,459,461],{},"When both pagination and the summary are off, the bottom only shows ",[322,456,457],{},"#footer","; without ",[322,460,457],{},", there is no bottom area.",[338,463,465],{"id":464},"loading-and-empty-data","Loading and empty data",[312,467,468,469,472,473,476,477,480,481,352,484,487,488,491,492,410],{},"When the component is created while loading with no data, skeleton rows are shown; when re-querying with existing data, the data fades and switches with a height transition. ",[322,470,471],{},"empty"," is the empty-data text, using the table default when not set; with ",[322,474,475],{},"transition"," set to ",[322,478,479],{},"false",", no transition plays. Set the skeleton row count and height with ",[322,482,483],{},"skeleton-rows",[322,485,486],{},"skeleton-class","; when not passed, they follow the site-wide ",[322,489,490],{},"components.table"," settings. The behavior is the same as ",[316,493,319],{"href":494},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Ftable#loading-and-empty-data",[366,496],{"name":497},"list-card-states",[312,499,500,501,352,504,507,508,511,512,410],{},"The title \"Results\" and the bottom summary switch with the locale (\"Results\" and \"Showing 1 to 10 of 25 results.\" in English, \"查詢結果\" and its summary in Traditional Chinese), and can be overridden globally with the ",[322,502,503],{},"listCard.title",[322,505,506],{},"listCard.summary"," texts; \"Loading…\" and \"No data\" belong to the ",[322,509,510],{},"